Package: wirewizard-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: WireWizardGUI contributors <esolotin@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: graphviz, libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgl1, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-util1, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1
Homepage: https://github.com/esolotin/wirewizard_gui
Description: Desktop editor for WireViz wiring projects
 WireWizardGUI provides a graphical editor, YAML preview and rendered wiring
 diagram preview for WireViz projects.
